{"id":"a95c8ce648dde2ec","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-measure7-entropy-of-partition.md","title":"ZFC Measure7 Entropy Of Partition","display":"df-zfc-measure7-entropy-of-partition — ZFC Measure7 Entropy Of Partition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure7-entropy-of-partition","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure7-entropy-of-partition"],"display":"df-zfc-measure7-entropy-of-partition — ZFC Measure7 Entropy Of Partition","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch08/58-df-probability]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","[[../batch19/58-df-exponential]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure7-entropy-of-partition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure7-entropy-of-partition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure7-entropy-of-partition — ZFC Measure7 Entropy Of Partition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e0db065132180df\" href=\"?note=5e0db065132180df\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-probability\">../batch08/58-df-probability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" href=\"?note=f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"689fa138a0ce2d6c\" href=\"?note=689fa138a0ce2d6c\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-exponential\">../batch19/58-df-exponential</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\">\\((X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\)</span> (probability-space candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_0\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal P_0\\in V\\)</span> (countable measurable-partition candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in V\">\\(h\\in V\\)</span> (entropy-value candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}\\)</span> (probability-measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5e0db065132180df\" href=\"?note=5e0db065132180df\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-probability\">../batch08/58-df-probability</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S\\)</span> (at-most-countable predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" href=\"?note=f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exp\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb C}\">\\(\\exp\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb C}\\)</span> (complex exponential, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"689fa138a0ce2d6c\" href=\"?note=689fa138a0ce2d6c\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-exponential\">../batch19/58-df-exponential</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7EntropyOfPartition}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7EntropyOfPartition}_S\\)</span> (partition-entropy predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}entropy\\text{-}of\\text{-}partition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7EntropyOfPartition}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,\\mathcal P_0,h)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\n\\mathcal P_0\\subseteq\\mathcal A\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(\\mathcal P_0)\\land\n\\bigcup\\mathcal P_0=X\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal P_0\\;(A\\neq B\\to A\\cap B=\\emptyset)\\bigr)\\land\nh\\in[0,\\infty]\\land\n\\exists\\ell\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\ell,\\mathbb R_{&gt;0},\\mathbb R)\\land\n\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;(\\exp(\\ell(t))=t)\\land\nh=-\\sum_{\\substack{A\\in\\mathcal P_0\\\\\\mu(A)&gt;0}}\\mu(A)\\ell(\\mu(A))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}entropy\\text{-}of\\text{-}partition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7EntropyOfPartition}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,\\mathcal P_0,h)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\n\\mathcal P_0\\subseteq\\mathcal A\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(\\mathcal P_0)\\land\n\\bigcup\\mathcal P_0=X\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal P_0\\;(A\\neq B\\to A\\cap B=\\emptyset)\\bigr)\\land\nh\\in[0,\\infty]\\land\n\\exists\\ell\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\ell,\\mathbb R_{&gt;0},\\mathbb R)\\land\n\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;(\\exp(\\ell(t))=t)\\land\nh=-\\sum_{\\substack{A\\in\\mathcal P_0\\\\\\mu(A)&gt;0}}\\mu(A)\\ell(\\mu(A))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Terms with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(A)=0\">\\(\\mu(A)=0\\)</span> contribute <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>; omitting them implements the convention <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\log 0=0\">\\(0\\log 0=0\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The quantified function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\">\\(\\ell\\)</span> is the real inverse of the exponential on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\">\\(\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\)</span>, so the logarithm's domain and codomain are explicit in the assertion.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-probability","status":"resolved","id":"5e0db065132180df","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-probability]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set","status":"resolved","id":"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-exponential","status":"resolved","id":"689fa138a0ce2d6c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-exponential]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-probability","status":"resolved","id":"5e0db065132180df","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}$ (probability-measure predicate, see [[../batch08/58-df-probability]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df